# Coordinator Loop

1. Call `agent_team_plan`.
2. If needed, suggest multi-agent mode to the user.
3. When enabled, call `agent_team_bootstrap`.
4. Call `agent_team_script`.
5. Spawn planner first.
6. Spawn one worker per independent module.
7. After each worker round, run reviewer.
8. Relay findings back to the owning worker.
9. When workers converge, run integrator if multiple workers exist.
10. Deliver final result to the user.
